<title>USA: Aames Financial Corp issues $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Aames Financial Corp issues $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Aames Financial Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Bear Stearns &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER AAMES FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.125 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.714   FIRST PAY DATE 5/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA3     YIELD 9.18 PCT     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P NR	  SPREAD 275 BP	CALLABLE NON-CALL FOUR</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER U.S. TREASURY 5.75 PCT DUE 2003</p>
<p>THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 30 PCT AT 110. --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
